  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Gold Rush**: rare: 10 archived performances [3]\n- **It's Raining Here This Morning**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **Highway Hipnosis**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n- **Sitting on Top of the World**: back after 192 archived shows (840 days); rare: 10 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2020-01-26.litz.schoepsMK41v.flac2496** (recommended): source not stated; 21 songs; 131 min [1]\n- **billystrings2020-01-26.litz.schoepsMK41v.flac16**: source not stated; 21 songs; 131 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2020-01-26.litz.schoepsMK41v.flac2496**: taped by Keith Litzenberger; transferred by Keith Litzenberger; source: Schoeps MK41v's>Schoeps KCY 250/5i>Baby Nbox>Sony PCM-M10 (@24 BIT / 96Khz) [1]. Also: Recorded and processed by Keith Litzenberger using Schoeps MK41v microphones with Schoeps KCY 250/5i preamps; Chain runs through a Baby Nbox into a Sony PCM-M10 recording at 24-bit/96kHz; edited in Sound Forge Pro 13, fades only, tracked in CDWAV, FLAC via Trader's Little Helper [1]\n- **billystrings2020-01-26.litz.schoepsMK41v.flac16**: taped by Keith Litzenberger; transferred by Keith Litzenberger; source: Schoeps MK41v's>Schoeps KCY 250/5i>Baby Nbox>Sony PCM-M10 [2]. Also: Same Litzenberger Schoeps source chain, recorded 24-bit/96kHz, then resampled to 16-bit/44.1kHz with POW-r dither in Sound Forge Pro 13; FLAC encoded [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings 2020-01-26 Show edition reg /100; AP reg /60 - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/storage-merch-thumbnail-img_0829_small_1639066067-jpg/) [4]",
